      "message": "Let an organisation ask, and an agent read where it belongs\n\nAn owner asks whoever runs the forge for more from the organisation's\nown page: a bigger allowance, or a forge of their own. The ask lands\nas a report, which the door, the console and GET /api/reports show\nwith the organisation named, so nobody has to find the operator's\naddress; POST /api/teams/{org}/ask does the same. Over MCP an agent\nreads the organisations a principal is on and what they are to each,\nwho is on an organisation, the teams inside it, and who holds what on\na repository, which is the whole of the organisation model an agent\nneeds to know and none of what it may change.\n\nTask: t-0at5gmv4zcj1kt1js3xca0ckvj\nChange-Id: Iasking0127\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
